{"id":1746572,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-10T12:07:44.439Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/5k7IS3x938gXwUI5uBsQsOH79ul.jpg","belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1746572,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["ES"],"original_language":"es","original_title":"Prologore","overview":"A murder takes place in a forest, though the killer is not seen. Later, inside a gloomy house, two mutant zombies calmly eat human flesh—possibly from the earlier murder—but an ambiguous psychopath appears and orders them both to go find fresh meat for his sick grandmother. The two zombies leave the house in search of victims, and when one of them finds one, the victim manages to fend off the attack and flees, leaving the zombie dying on the ground. Then the psychopath emerges from the woods and begins chasing the victim. The victim eventually stumbles into the mansion and, horrified, discovers the grandmother’s body, so he defends himself with a kitchen axe. Suddenly, the first zombie—now unharmed—appears, but the victim fends off the attack again by decapitating him. He flees the mansion in a panic. Then, suddenly, he wakes up from a nightmare and, distraught, goes to wash his face. But suddenly, the psychopath emerges from the shower and strangles him.","popularity":0.0071,"poster_path":"/2SmZhlswmqkpH655Hf56GHGlu5R.jpg","production_companies":[],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"1997-01-01","revenue":0,"runtime":9,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"Spanish","iso_639_1":"es","name":"Español"}],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Prologore","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":2765414,"known_for_department":"Visual Effects","name":"Mark Kintosh","original_name":"Mark Kintosh","popularity":0.2719,"profile_path":null,"cast_id":5,"character":"","credit_id":"6a78ecace5a6d2a9caf5dffa","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":2765411,